        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>AHI SIG3001 Stainless Steel Mortise Lock Entry Handleset</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe Stainless Steel Mortise Door Lock Handleset has a retro feel. This handleset is made from the highest quality 304 Solid Stainless Steel. Choose from a huge array of interior trim levers.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>All Stainless Steel Trim:</b> Resistant to corrosion, knocks, scratches and abrasion making it an ideal material for door hardware. Durable in appearance and function even after years of use on your home or office. \r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Mortise Lockcase:</b> Heavy gauge plated steel UL & ULC listed for custom residential, high traffic commercial, institutional and industrial uses where durability and security are of the greatest concern.  UL-listed for 3 hours. UL label stamped on front (ULC available) UL sticker on case.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Single Cylinder:</b> From the exterior, a thumb piece operates the handleset latch and a key operates the deadbolt. From the inside, a thumbturn unlocks the deadbolt and a knob/lever operates the latch.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nAlso available: Matching <a href=\"/products/stainless-steel-dummy-handleset-ahi-sig3001d\"><b>SIG3001D Stainless Steel Dummy Handleset</b></a> for the inactive door on a French Door Set (Double Doors).\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Features</b> of the AHI SIG3001 Mortise Entry Handleset:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Keyway: Schlage C</li>\r\n<li>3 Hour fire rated</li>\r\n<li>Latch Bolt: Brass anti-friction type</li>\r\n<li>Deadbolt: Forged brass with hardened steel inserts</li>\r\n<li>Package includes: Interior and Exterior plates, Interior Trim, American Mortise box, Schlage Cylinder.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications:</b> for AHI SIG3001 Stainless Steel Entry Handleset\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: 304 Solid Stainless Steel Trim</li>\r\n<li>Finish: <b>Satin Stainless Steel</b></li>\r\n<li>Exterior Plate Height: 17-1/4\" (438 mm)</li>\r\n<li>Exterior Plate Width: 3-1/4\" (83 mm)</li>\r\n<li>Interior Plate Height: 11\" (280 mm)</li>\r\n<li>Interior Plate Width: 3-1/4\" (83 mm)</li>\r\n<li>Door Thickness: 1-3/4\" Minimum thickness, optional up to 3\" thick</li>\r\n<li>Backset: 2-3/4\" (70mm)</li>\r\n<li>Mortise Case Faceplate: 1-1/4\" Stainless steel</li>\r\n<li>Latch Bolt: Brass anti-friction type</li>\r\n<li>Strike plate: Stainless steel ANSI standard 4-7/8\" x 1-1/4\" x 1-1/8\" lip to center</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/SIG3001.pdf?v=1691093349\"><b>AHI SIG3001 Dimensions (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>Sold Individually. </i>\r\n</p>",
            "seo": {
